{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32675","headline":"送元叙上人归上党 · 刘沧","name":"送元叙上人归上党","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太行关路战尘收，白日思乡别沃州。\n薄暮焚香临野烧，清晨漱齿涉寒流。\n谿边残垒空云木，山上孤城对驿楼。\n此去寂寥寻旧迹，苍苔满径竹斋秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32675.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32675","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}